{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000028:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70163813c9356de69584d2c95617e0b93528186d2a8e3d11ab191a37f1abaf09",
      "text": "让大家久等了。拍摄马上开始。\n请各位站到和上次相同的位置上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad4ce4a3796cd370e1562afd13f7c0ff621f4e6150bd78f1d652e85771537197",
      "text": "……好，OK！只要原地跳起然后\n落地，应该就能和上次的画面完美衔接上了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b50c2351fa0d751f7695bca68da10e7e38496f632f00c36e75c3ac3db788e7b9",
      "text": "那么，拍摄开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0833fbb59d7c909e5ae635ee995682dc9f0540dc45a940235bef72312a62751",
      "text": "“在一天之内学会并跳出\n315频道的片尾曲舞蹈”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5724aa3b2cc08a3d431d9593f97bdfd8f55346eaa497f099f0ea2315aef92fd1",
      "text": "要学的，是我们所跳曲目之外的另外两首。\n而且，还附带了必须在傍晚前完成的时间限制哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35438d3be6065c98a61b22aeca2914a020d70f71a19b24d31dd69ad19e630588",
      "text": "要在傍晚前全部学会确实挺有难度的，\n不过我们会努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47f562f651686bf84eee45d3d863fdbee2d600933ce2da4a85efbc7a82196fe5",
      "text": "没问题的啦！秋山你不是在企划开始前，\n就已经看过其他片尾曲的编舞视频了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f8142e9aa752507a2ca21c93e05fd5107711b8584760bb1bf4256632a3310d1",
      "text": "只要跳起来，身体自然而然就会跟着动起来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bef80a22b423628dc298e7d7b2d0a0c7125d4377269252a07552c51d7445f4e4",
      "text": "好嘞，那就立刻开工吧！\n噢噢噢，放马过来吧！Burning！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000183:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000218:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca7bcf0c4ffa9a043e7c4d4678c9b3d9d1e2c90e4a3461a2d2b4d83491157d1b",
      "text": "各位，休息时间到了！记得要好好\n补充水分哦！休息结束后就是正式演出了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
